  "description": "A Richese-inspired heavy dart launcher adapted for frontier squad combat. Three heavy darts deliver a deliberate burst with a long recovery. Powerful against exposed targets, its fast darts are stopped by Holtzman fields. This frontier design is a gameplay adaptation, not a claimed historical model. Its heavy darts put greater strain on a blocking field than light darts.",
